	(text "Buttons: BTN1 = PC15, BTN2 = PC13, BTN3 = PE2 (active low, MCU internal pull-ups, no external pull resistors).\nPC13/PC15 are RTC-domain pins: fine as inputs, keep them low-speed. BLE bind button lives on the BLE sheet (SW501).\nBOOT (SW604): pulls BOOT0 high through 1k (R201 10k on MCU sheet pulls it low). Hold BOOT + tap NRST (SW605) -> ROM bootloader (USB DFU).\nLEDs active high: LED_STATUS = PB13 (TIM8_CH2, not TIM1_CH1N: that would share a duty with PB8), LED_ACT = PB8 (TIM1_CH1), BLE_LED = BLE P0.20 (nRF PWM) -> all three dimmable by PWM.\nPWR (DVDD_3V3) and LANE (LANE_3V3) LEDs are hard-wired on the Power sheet (2k = dim, always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c34342d8-d8ec-48b2-a9d1-98226f4d59b3")
	)
